{"kind": "mod", "id": 1503, "name": "Add Missing Quest Weapon Requirements", "slug": "add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements", "teaser": "Dynamically reads and applies overrides to the weapon restrictions of kill/eliminate conditions of quests based on override files. Normally, the conditions' weapons need to be manually updated for every added gun. This mod aims to automate this process.", "owner_name": "GuiltyMan", "downloads": 13330, "favourites": 27, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.guiltyman.addmissingquestrequirements", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Quests", "category_id": 7, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T09:03:51.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-24T19:36:13.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-24T19:36:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0 <4.1.0", "latest_version": "2.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>AddMissingQuestRequirements</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Server-side SPT 4.x mod that auto-expands quest weapon requirements to include modded clones.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>A server-side SPT mod that automatically includes <strong>modded weapons and attachments</strong> in base-game quest conditions.</p>\n<p>Every vanilla quest that says <em>“kill 10 PMCs with an AK-74”</em> implicitly means “any modded AK-74 clone too”  but the game only counts the specific weapon IDs BSG listed. This mod fixes that at server startup: it figures out what category each weapon and attachment belongs to, then expands quest conditions to include every same-category item installed on your server.</p>\n<p><strong>No in-raid cost.</strong> Everything happens once, when the server boots. Nothing is patched on the fly.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>For an expanded set of fine-tuned configurations and overrides, see the addon: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/74/amqwr-patches-addon#description\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/addon/74/amqwr-patches-addon#description</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr />\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Build or download the release. Drop the whole folder into <code>SPT/</code>:</p>\n<pre><code>SPT/user/mods/GuiltyMan-AddMissingQuestRequirements/\n    AddMissingQuestRequirements.dll\n    config/\n        config.jsonc\n    MissingQuestWeapons/\n        QuestOverrides.jsonc\n        WeaponOverrides.jsonc\n        AttachmentOverrides.jsonc\n</code></pre>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Start the SPT server. You should see one line in the server console:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>AddMissingQuestRequirements ready in 1047ms — 20 of 49 weapon-quests changed (50 of 918 conditions). Weapons: 203 items across 66 types. Attachments: 1990 items across 1338 types.</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Launch the game. Quest kill counts should now tick on modded weapons of the same type.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Nothing to configure to use the mod</strong> — defaults cover all vanilla quests. Read on only if you want to customize behaviour or add support for your own mods.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2>Getting help</h2>\n<p>Turn on <code>\"debug\": true</code> and restart the server once, then open an issue with:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Your <code>config.jsonc</code>, <code>WeaponOverrides.jsonc</code>, <code>QuestOverrides.jsonc</code>, <code>AttachmentOverrides.jsonc</code>.</li>\n<li><code>AddMissingQuestRequirements-debug-report.json</code> and <code>AddMissingQuestRequirements-debug-report.html</code> from next to the DLL.</li>\n<li><code>AddMissingQuestRequirements.log</code> from next to the DLL.</li>\n<li>A description of the quest / weapon / attachment that’s misbehaving.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>More information at github: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/theGuiltyMan/SPT-Add-Missing-Quest-Weapon-Requirements\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/theGuiltyMan/SPT-Add-Missing-Quest-Weapon-Requirements</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 295, "published_at": "2024-07-07T22:17:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/1.1.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1439, "published_at": "2024-07-10T16:27:12.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1169, "published_at": "2024-12-14T17:50:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 414, "published_at": "2025-08-12T00:44:34.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/1.5.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.5.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 844, "published_at": "2025-08-14T22:09:16.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1503/add-missing-quest-weapon-requirements/1.5.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", 